# §11.5.2.2 stays UNCOVERED: stack exhaustion arrives as an untrappable wasm trap rather than a
# catchable Error, and making it catchable means synthesizing a Java exception at jav_call_fn's
# frame guard — a VM change. One row in the ratchet, which is where an unmet rule belongs.
#
# 423 -> 409 (previous): all of chapter 5 (conformance/jls/Ch5.java + the first
# conformance/reject cases) and the rest of chapter 4. Chapter 5 is the one that states its own
# cardinality — 19 widening and 23 narrowing primitive conversions — so both are enumerated in
